{"message":"For minimizing ATM costs abroad, I recommend the Bluest Account. It has no Rho-Bank foreign ATM withdrawal fee and rebates eligible foreign ATM operator fees up to $50 per month. Third-party ATM fees above that cap may still apply. Its daily ATM withdrawal limit is $1,500.

For comparison, the Purple Account rebates up to $30 per month, while the Green Fee-Free Account has no Rho-Bank foreign ATM fee but does not list a foreign ATM operator-fee rebate. Bluest therefore offers the strongest ATM-fee protection for a three-month international trip.

Would you like me to help open a Bluest Account? To begin, please provide your full name and any two of these: date of birth, email address, phone number, or address."}
